[00:00.00] 作词 : Bjarte Ludvigsen/Caleb Shapiro/Mads Vathne Lervik/Robert Ziff Resnick/Catherine Beatrice Cheadle/Katie Sky
[00:00.18] 作曲 : Bjarte Ludvigsen/Caleb Shapiro/Mads Vathne Lervik/Robert Ziff Resnick/Catherine Beatrice Cheadle/Katie Sky
[00:00.36] 编曲 : Rob Resnick/Bjarte Ludvigsen/Billy Attridge/Mads Vathne Lervik/Miles Walker
[00:00.55]I see your monsters
{"我看见你的心魔"}
[00:03.32]I see your pain
{"我看见你的伤痛"}
[00:06.31]Tell me your problems
{"告诉我你的困扰"}
[00:08.54]I'll chase them away
{"我会将它们驱散"}
[00:11.54]I'll be your lighthouse
{"我会是你的灯塔"}
[00:13.93]I'll make it okay
{"我会让一切好转"}
[00:16.75]When I see your monsters
{"当我看见你的心魔"}
[00:19.52]I'll stand there so brave
{"我会勇敢地站立"}
[00:21.54]And chase them all away
{"将它们全部赶走"}
[00:27.74]A cup of coffee still steaming
{"一杯咖啡仍冒着热气"}
[00:29.31]Staring back at me, it's blacker than the night
{"凝视着我 比夜色更漆黑"}
[00:33.26]I'm awake but still sleeping
{"我醒着却仍在沉睡"}
[00:34.97]I keep telling myself I'll be alright (I won't)
{"不断告诉自己会好起来（我不会）"}
[00:38.02]And I know it can't get worse than today
{"我知道不会比今天更糟"}
[00:40.03]Sitting here and she's trying to rehearse what to say
{"坐在这里 她正练习要说的话"}
[00:42.46]See, she's in the bathroom hoping I'm not in earshot
{"看 她在浴室里希望我听不见"}
[00:45.73]While she's getting used to the sound of a teardrop (Splash)
{"当她逐渐习惯泪滴的声音（啪嗒）"}
[00:49.28]It hits the tile
{"它落在瓷砖上"}
[00:50.40]And I know it's been a while since you seen me
{"我知道你已很久没见到我"}
[00:52.28]Smile and laugh like I used to
{"像从前那样微笑与大笑"}
[00:53.84]I've been in denial since it happened
{"事发后我一直否认现实"}
[00:55.91]Just take me to the past
{"请带我回到过去"}
[00:57.26]Cuz I just can't imagine losing you (too)
{"因为我无法想象失去你（也）"}
[00:59.55]I can't explain this so I'll keep it all inside
{"我无法解释所以将一切埋藏心底"}
[01:02.22]Wear my pain, but it's masked by my pride
{"承受痛苦 但被我的骄傲掩盖"}
[01:04.90]She came to hold me and she cried
{"她来抱住我，哭了"}
[01:06.66]Told me this as she stared into my eyes, said
{"她凝视着我的眼睛，对我说"}
[01:08.74]I see your monsters
{"我看见你的心魔"}
[01:11.56]I see your pain
{"我看见你的痛苦"}
[01:14.27]Tell me your problems
{"告诉我你的烦恼"}
[01:16.70]I'll chase them away
{"我会把它们赶走"}
[01:19.63]I'll be your lighthouse
{"我会成为你的灯塔"}
[01:21.94]I'll make it okay
{"我会让一切好起来"}
[01:25.00]When I see your monsters
{"当我看见你的心魔"}
[01:27.47]I'll stand there so brave
{"我会勇敢地站在那里"}
[01:29.54]And chase them all away
{"把它们全都赶走"}
[01:32.16]I can't
{"我做不到"}
[01:33.02]You won't like what you see
{"你不会喜欢你所看到的"}
[01:34.58]If you were in my head and had to hear my pleas
{"如果你在我的脑海里，不得不听我的恳求"}
[01:37.35]It's like
{"就像"}
[01:38.25]I can't believe this is happening to me
{"我无法相信这会发生在我身上"}
[01:39.61]And could someone please shut this ******* answering machine
{"谁能关掉这该死的答录机"}
[01:42.09]So I can start leaving these messages
{"好让我开始留下这些留言"}
[01:44.25]That you will never get
{"你永远不会收到的留言"}
[01:45.74]And all these cries for help
{"所有这些求救的呼喊"}
[01:47.19]You'll never see and never check
{"你永远不会看见，永远不会查看"}
[01:48.36]But I guess it's easy for you to leave me
{"但我想，你离开我很容易"}
[01:50.52]But believe me
{"但相信我"}
[01:51.53]See this isn't something that Imma just forget
{"这不是我会轻易忘记的事"}
[01:54.30]I would trade it all for one more minute
{"我愿意用一切来换多一分钟"}
[01:56.12]Don't you see I really need you to talk to
{"难道你看不出　我真的需要你和我谈谈"}
[01:59.26]I'm still sitting here wondering who did it
{"我仍坐在这里　想着是谁造成的这一切"}
[02:01.38]While I'm staring out our front door
{"当我凝视着我们的前门"}
[02:03.00]Knowing you'll never walk through
{"心里明白你再也不会走进来"}
[02:05.52]Said you'd come right back
{"你说过马上就回来"}
[02:08.19]And now you're gone like that
{"可如今你就像那样消失了"}
[02:10.31]A blank stare as I stand so alone
{"我独自站着　眼神空洞"}
[02:11.99]And know you're never coming home (damn)
{"明白你再也不会回家了（该死）"}
[02:14.45]I see your monsters
{"我看见你内心的怪物"}
[02:16.32]I see your pain
{"我看见你的痛苦"}
[02:18.84]Tell me your problems
{"告诉我你的烦恼"}
[02:21.69]I'll chase them away
{"我会把它们统统赶走"}
[02:24.84]I'll be your lighthouse
{"我会成为你的灯塔"}
[02:27.10]I'll make it okay
{"我会让一切好起来"}
[02:29.82]When I see your monsters
{"当我看见你内心的怪物"}
[02:32.45]I'll stand there so brave
{"我会勇敢地站在那里"}
[02:34.67]And chase them all away
{"把它们全都赶走"}
[02:37.90]I got a heart made of fool's gold
{"我有一颗愚人金般的心"}
[02:39.71]Got me feeling so cold
{"让我感觉如此冰冷"}
[02:41.17]But Keep chipping away
{"但请继续一点点凿开它"}
[02:43.72]All the promises that I told
{"我曾许下的所有承诺"}
[02:45.19]Felt like I was on those
{"感觉我仿佛就置身其上"}
[02:46.85]But keep slipping away
{"却不断从手中滑落"}
[02:48.91]I want nobody else
{"我谁都不想要"}
[02:50.12]But it's hard to get to know me
{"但了解我　真的很难"}
[02:51.54]When I don't know myself
{"当我迷失自我"}
[02:52.70]And it helps
{"这很有帮助"}
[02:53.36]Cuz I felt
{"因为我感到"}
[02:54.02]I was down, I was out
{"我曾低落，我曾出局"}
[02:55.23]Then you looked at me now
{"然后你现在看着我"}
[02:56.69]And said
{"说道"}
